From 38f6cee24db049c78fc256499f789edf0aaea27f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 05:47:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Make app deployable on Vercel with MongoDB Atlas and safe
 admin seeding

- Add Vercel serverless entry (api/index.ts) and vercel.json rewrites; split
  Express app into server/app.ts so server.ts and Vercel share it
- Require MONGODB_URI on Vercel/production; never fall back to the embedded DB
- Make admin seeding idempotent: no longer wipes admins, interns, projects,
  reports or notifications on every start; existing passwords are kept unless
  ADMIN_SYNC_PASSWORDS=true
- Read admin credentials from env only (bcrypt-hashed in the DB); remove
  plaintext passwords and the default JWT secret from source and .env.example
- Stop tracking the embedded .mongodb_data files
- Use explicit .js extensions in server imports for Node ESM

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016NcWNgDoCT2tCvdvW5detW
